# The Warrior's Path (battlefield.warriors_path, Sealion's Den): the registrant's requirements (7-5 current and
# Mission[6][748]Status 1). Each gets IRON_GATE_LOCKED (7110, the zone's default), no menu: main (7-5 at Status 3), bob
# (Garden of Antiquity current with Status 1) and cat (Calm Before the Storm current with Status 1).
lists SealionsDen/_0w0/onTrigger
char zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
bob: mission Cop GardenOfAntiquity current
bob: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 1
cat: mission Cop CalmBeforeTheStorm current
cat: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 1
login
trigger _0w0
finish-if-event
bob: login
bob: trigger _0w0
bob: finish-if-event
cat: login
cat: trigger _0w0
cat: finish-if-event
